_Mansion%2C_Sidney.jpg","l":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Whitby_Mansion,_Sidney.jpg","a":"Nyttend","lic":"Public domain","licu":"","src":"Wikimedia Commons","alt":"Whitby Mansion, Sidney"},"wx":["The Whitby Mansion is a historic mansion in Sidney, Ohio, United States. Built in 1890, it was originally the home of W.H.C. Goode, a Sidney industrialist.","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitby_Mansion"]}}}